{"2608310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hermit Simulator", "steam_appid": 2608310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">HERMIT SIMULATOR IN OPEN WORLD IS WAITING FOR YOU SOON!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave behind the routine and bustle of the metropolis and become a modern hermit-farmer! Go into the deep atmospheric forest with your friends and build a new home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">CO-OP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can test your resilience in a single-player experience or invite your loyal friends for a fun adventure and team-based cooperation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">FARMING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in animal husbandry and crop production. There are several species of animals and plants at your disposal. Buy, grow, raise, breed and sell! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of the hero's indicators and don't let him die, and also don't forget about your best four-legged friend. Get food and water, but don't get caught in the fangs of a predator!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">DRIVING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase different types of transport for your daily tasks. From agricultural machinery to premium cars, motor vehicles and even water transport! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">HUNTING AND FISHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a trap or a primitive spear and go to the nearest pond to get fish! You can eat or sell the extracted meat in your stand. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">TRADING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your products and extracted resources on the stand near the highway and sell them to customers visiting you. The larger the assortment, the higher the earnings! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">GATHERING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through the forest and pick up branches, stones, mushrooms, cones and wild berries! Collected resources are always needed in everyday life or trade. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">BUILDING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop down trees, then craft planks and other materials to build everything you need, from a paddock to a hangar and your own hut! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">CRAFTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft the necessary items and objects from the collected resources. It can be an axe or a bonfire! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">EXPLORATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the map, mark the place you want to visit and go hiking towards adventures and beautiful views! But don't forget to be properly equipped.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">HERMIT SIMULATOR IN OPEN WORLD IS WAITING FOR YOU SOON!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave behind the routine and bustle of the metropolis and become a modern hermit-farmer! Go into the deep atmospheric forest with your friends and build a new home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">CO-OP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can test your resilience in a single-player experience or invite your loyal friends for a fun adventure and team-based cooperation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">FARMING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in animal husbandry and crop production. There are several species of animals and plants at your disposal. Buy, grow, raise, breed and sell! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of the hero's indicators and don't let him die, and also don't forget about your best four-legged friend. Get food and water, but don't get caught in the fangs of a predator!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">DRIVING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase different types of transport for your daily tasks. From agricultural machinery to premium cars, motor vehicles and even water transport! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">HUNTING AND FISHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a trap or a primitive spear and go to the nearest pond to get fish! You can eat or sell the extracted meat in your stand. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">TRADING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your products and extracted resources on the stand near the highway and sell them to customers visiting you. The larger the assortment, the higher the earnings! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">GATHERING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through the forest and pick up branches, stones, mushrooms, cones and wild berries! Collected resources are always needed in everyday life or trade. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">BUILDING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop down trees, then craft planks and other materials to build everything you need, from a paddock to a hangar and your own hut! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">CRAFTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft the necessary items and objects from the collected resources. It can be an axe or a bonfire! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">EXPLORATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the map, mark the place you want to visit and go hiking towards adventures and beautiful views! But don't forget to be properly equipped.</p>", "short_description": "Being a hermit is not easy, but it is the way to freedom, where you have to survive and build a new home. Farming, hunting, fishing, gathering, building, crafting, trading and exploration await you in the hermit simulator! Will you be able to survive on your way and become the master of the forest?", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Turkish, Ukrainian, Czech, Japanese, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608310/c5d8602b347684634b0038b7c0a04f8ef1ae4211/header.jpg?t=1788272618", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608310/86f4c49f2bbd1866d21a37a45c7cca6424ce4dbd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788272618", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608310/86f4c49f2bbd1866d21a37a45c7cca6424ce4dbd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788272618", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / AMD Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 670 (2 GB) / AMD R9 270 (2 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.13+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E7400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 3000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Trailer music from #Uppbeat (free for Creators!):<br />\r\nhttps://uppbeat.io/t/danijel-zambo/beltane", "developers": ["Svoboda Creations"], "publishers": ["Svoboda Creations"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, 